@SchoolManagementApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5065

### 1. Yeni Classroom yaratmaq
POST {{SchoolManagementApi_HostAddress}}/api/classroom
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "10A"
}

### 2. Classroom-a aid Student yaratmaq
POST {{SchoolManagementApi_HostAddress}}/api/student
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Əli Məmmədov",
  "age": 16,
  "classroomId": 1
}

### 3. Course-lar yaratmaq
POST {{SchoolManagementApi_HostAddress}}/api/course
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Riyaziyyat"
}

###
POST {{SchoolManagementApi_HostAddress}}/api/course
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "İngilis dili"
}

### 4. Student-i hər iki Course-a əlavə etmək
POST {{SchoolManagementApi_HostAddress}}/api/studentcourse
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 1,
  "courseId": 1
}

###
POST {{SchoolManagementApi_HostAddress}}/api/studentcourse
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 1,
  "courseId": 2
}

### 5. GET sorğusu ilə Student-in qatıldığı kursları gətirmək
GET {{SchoolManagementApi_HostAddress}}/api/studentcourse/1
Accept: application/json

### 6. Bütün məlumatları yoxlamaq (GET sorğuları)
GET {{SchoolManagementApi_HostAddress}}/api/classroom
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{SchoolManagementApi_HostAddress}}/api/student
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{SchoolManagementApi_HostAddress}}/api/course
Accept: application/json